OL,3,ABystander says he had 'no choice' but
OL,4,Ato tackle driver who struck Australian
OL,5,AMP twice with car
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,8,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,9,Fby a local barber before being taken
OL,10,Finto custody
OL,12,FThe suspect has been named by local
OL,13,Fmedia as Brendan Nugent, who was
OL,14,Fpreviously well known in the local area
OL,15,Fas an environmental campaigner
OL,17,FPolice say it was an 'isolated
OL,18,Fincident' and they are working to
OL,19,Fidentify potential charges
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
